---
layout: base.njk
title: Categories
description: 주제별로 글을 찾아보세요.
permalink: /categories/
---
<section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE BY TOPIC</p><h1>Categories<span>.</span></h1><p>{{ description }}</p></section>
<div class="topic-grid category-grid">{% for category in topics %}<a class="topic-card" href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/"><div class="topic-top"><span class="micro-label">0{{ loop.index }} / {{ category.label }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h2>{{ category.name }}</h2><p>{{ category.description }}</p><span class="topic-count">{{ collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) | length }}개의 기록</span></a>{% endfor %}</div>
